{"text": "Sane\nPHILIP MORRIS\n\n\u2018 P.O, 80x 26608, RICHMOND, VIRGINIA 29261 TELEPHONE (808) 274-2000\n\u2018ebruary 26, 1987\n\n{TOBACCO TECHNOLOGY Grol,\u2019\n\nPhilip Morris International\n8120 N.W, 53 Street\nSuite 200 :\nMiami, Florida 33166 iy\n\nMr. Henrik Ravn \\\n\nDear Henrik:\n\nPlease find enclosed the regional office copy of the 1986 Farm Chemicals\nHandbook, This handbook offers the most couprehensive information on a\nbroad range of pesticides currently available on the market. I hope that\nthis handbook provides a useful reference to you in answering questions\nconcerning pesticide use in your region.\n\nI would also like to take this opportunity to remind you that it is\nimperative that we maintain a comprehensive program on pesticide safety\n@anagement and use. Prior to entering into a new production season, we -\nshould make every effort that our growers are informed on the proper, safe\nand efficient use of pesticides.\n\nI would also add that since pesticides are becoming an increasing issue of\nPublic concern that we make every effort to eliminate the unnecessary use\nof pesticides, It is imperative, in order to avoid the risk of accidental\nexposure or contamination of our product with pesticide residues, that we\ndevelop and implement an educational program to reach all of our regional\njeaf managers, as well as the personnel and growers that are producing for\nthen.\n\nIf you have eny questions, or if I can be of any assistance to you in\ndeveloping these programs, please don't fail to contact me,\n\nSincerely,\n\nfilo 6 HW\n\nDale A. Hill\nManager, Agronony\n\nxe: Dr. R, B. Seligman\nMr. JP'van Hare\nMr. 0, W. Dudley IIZ\nDr. L. M. Sykes\n\n80456S0002\n\nMARLBORO EENSON HEDGES MERTT VIRGINASLS FIRLAMENTLIGHTS PLYEAS SARATOGA CAMORDGE ALPE MULTRLTER",
